WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:03.694
Start dependencies first. Stop the whole stack with one command.

00:04.144 --> 00:06.280
The web service depends on the API.

00:08.744 --> 00:10.184
Start the stack.

00:10.634 --> 00:13.978
devhost starts the API first, then the web service.

00:14.427 --> 00:17.074
The web service answers on its HTTPS hostname.

00:20.067 --> 00:21.878
Stopping takes one command.
